# translation files handling
The main building block is a XLS file with these columns:
L1: key
L2: inner key for nested structs (just one level of nesting)
EN: english strings
IT: italian strings

Example at the end of this README

# TBD:  Mui React Select with grouping

usually run inside venv
pip install  openpyxl csv
pip install google-cloud-translate==2.0.1 polib
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./google_key.json


Scripts:
xls2i18n:  from a  xls file will produce the it/en files corresponding to the  xls rows, under a local directory public/locales/
    python xls2i18n.py xlsx_file

i18n2xls: extracts from the it/en translation files, building the xlsx file. Handles missing keys in either files
    python i18n2xls.py translations_dir  basename_of_json_file
    e.g. python i18n2xls.py ../InternetComputer/digitaltechne/src/frontend/public/locales documento

translate: creates missing rows, using google translate (TBD)


XLSX File example:

L1      L2      EN      IT
pippo           Goofy   Pippo
DonaldDuck              Donald Duck     Paperino
DaisyDuck               Daisy Duck      Paperina
"Donald Duck Nephews"   
        Huey    Huey    Qui
        Dewey   Dewey   Quo
        Louie   Louie   Qua
"Daisy Duck Nephews"    
        April   April   Ely
        May     May     Emy
        June    June    Evy

